@startuml
title EcoTrack Platform - Organization Management Frontend Bounded Context Layers
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle

package "Organization Management Frontend Bounded Context" {
  class "Presentation" as Frontend_orgmgmt_Presentation <<layer>>
  class "Application" as Frontend_orgmgmt_Application <<layer>>
  class "Domain" as Frontend_orgmgmt_Domain <<layer>>
  class "Infrastructure" as Frontend_orgmgmt_Infrastructure <<layer>>
}

Frontend_orgmgmt_Presentation ..> Frontend_orgmgmt_Application : dispatches actions
Frontend_orgmgmt_Application ..> Frontend_orgmgmt_Domain : reads / updates view models
Frontend_orgmgmt_Application ..> Frontend_orgmgmt_Infrastructure : requests data
Frontend_orgmgmt_Infrastructure ..> Frontend_orgmgmt_Domain : maps responses to

@enduml
